{
  "$comment": [
    "Representative replies of the Scripts host bridge, one or more per op, as the deckpilot.scripts guest expects them: {\"ok\": value} or {\"error\": {code: CallErrorCode, message, script?: {code: ErrorCode, message, repository?, command?, path?, confirmation?: {token}}}}.",
    "The requests are not here: they are script-requests.json, a byte-for-byte copy of DeckPilot's plugins/runtime/crates/abi/tests/fixtures/script-requests.json (the one contract of both repositories). The guest's tests (src/tests_fixture.rs) answer their drivers with these replies, hold every reply under maxReplyBytes and check that the guest accepts each."
